{"id":"ciertamente","lemma":"ciertamente","pos":"adv","rank":1569,"glosses":["certainly"],"ipa":"/ˌθjeɾtaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-ciertamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ciertamente es diferente.","en":"It's definitely different.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611334","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"differently"}]},{"text":"Tom ciertamente no está feliz.","en":"Tom is definitely not happy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306300","words":[null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"happy, merry"}]},{"text":"Sí, ciertamente.","en":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/502602","words":[{"g":"yes"},null]},{"text":"Tom ciertamente habla un montón.","en":"Tom certainly talks a lot.","words":[null,null,{"g":"speech"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"synonym of mucho"]]},{"text":"Ciertamente, estaré triste si muere.","en":"I'll certainly be sad if he dies.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"As a temporary state."},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"}]}]}